hadiths[43]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1653","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya. Phir Aap se jihad mein ijazat mangi. To Aap ne farmaya: [Kya tumhare walidain zinda hain?] Us ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: [Phir un dono mein jihad karo]."
"1654","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: [Jhoole mein sirf teen ne kalam kiya: Isa. Aur Bani Israil mein ek shakhs tha jise Juraij kaha jata hai. Wo namaz parhta tha. Us ki maan us ke paas aayi aur use pukara. To us ne kaha: Main use jawab dun ya namaz parhun? Phir us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Use maut na de yahan tak ke use fahisha aurton ke chehre dikhaye. Aur Juraij apne ibadat-khane mein tha. Phir ek aurat us ke samne aayi aur us se baat ki. Phir us ne inkar kiya. Phir wo charwahe ke paas aayi. Phir usے apne aap se qabu diya. Phir ladka jana. Phir us ne kaha: Juraij se hai. Phir wo us ke paas aaye. Phir unhon ne us ke ibadat-khane ko tod diya, use utara aur gali di. Phir us ne wuzu kiya aur namaz parhi. Phir ladke ke paas aaya. Phir us ne kaha: Ae ladke! Tumhara baap kaun hai? Us ne kaha: Charwaha. Unhon ne kaha: Hum tumhara ibadat-khana sone se banayenge. Us ne kaha: Nahi, magar mitti se. Aur ek aurat thi jo Bani Israil mein se apne bete ko doodh pila rahi thi. Phir us ke paas sawar mard guzra jo nishan wala tha. Phir us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Mere bete ko is jaisa bana. Phir us ne us ka seena chhora aur sawar ki taraf mutawajjah hua. Phir us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Mujhe is jaisa na bana. Phir us ke seene ki taraf mutawajjah hua aur use choosta raha]. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Goya main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekhta hun ke Wo apni ungli choos rahe hain. [Phir londi ke paas se guzra. Phir us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Mere bete ko is jaisi na bana. Phir us ne us ka seena chhora. Phir us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Mujhe is jaisi bana. Phir us ne kaha: Wo kyun? Phir us ne kaha: Sawar jabbaron mein se jabbar hai. Aur ye londi, wo kehte hain: Tum ne chori ki, zina kiya. Aur us ne nahi kiya]."
"1655","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: [Allah ne makhlooq paida ki. Phir jab us se farigh hua to rehem khada hua. Phir us ne Rahman ki kamar pakdi. Phir Us ne us se farmaya: Thehro. Us ne kaha: Ye us ka maqam hai jo qata-rahmi se Teri panah mangta hai. Us ne farmaya: Kya tum raazi nahi ke main us se milun jo tum se mile, us se katun jo tum se kate? Us ne kaha: Kyun nahi, ae mere Rab! Us ne farmaya: Phir tumhare liye]. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Parho agar chaho [phir kya qareeb hai ke agar tum phir jao to zameen mein fasad karo aur apni rishtedariyan kato]."
"1656","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair bin Mut'im (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: [Qata-rahmi karne wala Jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga]."
"1657","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Jo khush ho ke us ka rizq kushada kiya jaye ya us ke nishan mein der ki jaye to use chahiye ke sila-rahmi kare."
"1658","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Ek doosre se bughz na rakho, hasad na karo, peeth na phero. Aur Allah ke bande bhai bhai bano. Aur Musalman ke liye halal nahi ke wo apne bhai se teen din se zyada talluq tode]."
"1659","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Mard ke liye halal nahi ke wo apne bhai se teen raaton se zyada talluq tode. Wo dono milte hain. Phir ye munh pherta hai, ye munh pherta hai. Aur un dono mein behtar wo hai jo salam se ibtida kare]."
"1660","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Badh-gumani se bacho. Kyunke badh-gumani sab se jhooti baat hai. Na kaan lagao, na jasoosi karo, na najsh karo, na hasad karo, na bughz rakho, na peeth phero. Aur Allah ke bande bhai bhai bano]."
"1661","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zyada kisi ko dard mein sakht nahi dekha."
"1662","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas dakhil hua jabke Aap ko bukhar tha. Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak tumhe sakht bukhar hai. Aap ne farmaya: [Haan. Beshak mujhe aisa bukhar hota hai jaise tum mein se do mardon ko hota hai]. Main ne kaha: Ye is liye ke tumhare liye do ajr hain? Aap ne farmaya: [Haan. Ye aisa hi hai. Jo Musalman ho use takleef pahunche, kaanta aur us se upar, magar Allah us se us ki buraiyan mitata hai, jaise darakht apne patte girata hai]."
"1663","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Musalman ko jo museebat pahunche magar Allah us se usے mitata hai. Yahan tak ke kaanta jo use chubhe]."
"1664","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri aur Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: [Musalman ko thakan, beemari, fikr, gham, takleef, gham jo pahunche, yahan tak ke kaanta jo use chubhe, magar Allah us se us ki khatayein mitata hai]."
"1665","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se Ata bin Abi Rabah ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne mujh se kaha: Kya main tumhe Jannat walon mein se aurat na dikhayun? Main ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Ye siyah aurat hai. Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi. Phir us ne kaha: Beshak mujhe mirgi aati hai. Aur beshak main nangi ho jati hun. Phir mere liye Allah se dua farmayiye. Aap ne farmaya: [Agar chaho to sabr karo. Aur tumhare liye Jannat hai. Agar chaho to Allah se dua karun ke tumhe aafiyat de]. Phir us ne kaha: Main sabr karungi. Phir us ne kaha: Beshak main nangi ho jati hun. Phir Allah se dua farmayiye ke main nangi na hun. Phir Aap ne us ke liye dua farmayi."
"1666","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: [Zulm Qayamat ke din andhere hain]."
"1667","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai. Na us par zulm karta hai, na use hawale karta hai. Aur jo apne bhai ki hajat mein ho, Allah us ki hajat mein hota hai. Aur jo Musalman se museebat door kare, Allah us se Qayamat ke din ki museebaton mein se museebat door karega. Aur jo Musalman ka parda kare, Allah Qayamat ke din us ka parda karega]."
"1668","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Beshak Allah zalim ko mohlat deta hai. Yahan tak ke jab use pakadta hai to use nahi chhorta]. Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne parha [aur aisa hi tumhare Rab ka pakadna hai jab wo bastiyon ko pakadta hai jabke wo zalim hain. Beshak us ka pakadna dard-naak sakht hai]."
"1669","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ladayi mein they. Phir Muhajirin mein se ek mard ne Ansar mein se ek mard ko thokar mari. Phir Ansari ne kaha: Ae Ansar! Aur Muhajir ne kaha: Ae Muhajirin! Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ise suna. To Aap ne farmaya: [Jahiliyat ki pukar ka kya haal hai?] Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Muhajirin mein se ek mard ne Ansar mein se ek mard ko thokar mari. Phir Aap ne farmaya: [Use chhoro. Kyunke wo badbudar hai]. Phir Abdullah bin Ubayy ne ise suna. Phir us ne kaha: Unhon ne kiya? Suno! Allah ki qasam! Agar hum Madina laute to izzat wala us mein se zaleel ko zaroor nikalega. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar pahunchi. Phir Umar khade hue. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe chhoro ke main is munafiq ki gardan maar dun. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Use chhoro. Log ye baat na karein ke Muhammad apne sathiyon ko qatl karte hain]."
"1670","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: [Beshak momin momin ke liye imarat jaisa hai. Us ka ek hissa doosre ko mazboot karta hai]. Aur Aap ne apni ungliyan jaal banayein."
"1671","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Tum mominon ko un ki rehem-dili, mohabbat aur hamdardi mein jism jaisa dekhte ho. Jab hissa beemar ho to tamam jism us ke liye bedari aur bukhar se pukarta hai]."
"1672","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ijazat mangi. To Aap ne farmaya: [Use ijazat do. Qabeelay ka bura bhai, ya qabeelay ka beta]. Phir jab wo dakhil hua to Aap ne us se narm kalam kiya. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum ne jo kaha kaha, phir us se narm kalam kiya! Aap ne farmaya: [Ae Aisha! Beshak logon mein bura wo hai jise log us ki fahsh-goi se bachne ke liye chhorein, ya alwida kahein]."
"1673","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: [Ae Allah! Jo momin ho jise main ne gali di, usے us ke liye Qayamat ke din Teri taraf qurbat bana]."
"1674","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Kulthum bint Uqba (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: [Jhoot wo nahi jo logon ke darmiyan sulah kare. Phir bhalayi ugaye ya bhalayi kahe]."
"1675","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: [Beshak sach neki ki rah dikhata hai. Aur beshak neki Jannat ki rah dikhati hai. Aur beshak mard sach bolta hai yahan tak ke siddiq ho jata hai. Aur beshak jhoot burayi ki rah dikhata hai. Aur beshak burayi Aag ki rah dikhati hai. Aur beshak mard jhoot bolta hai yahan tak ke Allah ke paas kazzab likha jata hai]."
"1676","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Pehlewan kushti se nahi. Beshak pehlewan wo hai jo ghusse ke waqt apne aap ko قابو mein rakhe]."
"1677","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sulaiman bin Surad (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas do mard gali dene lage jabke hum Aap ke paas baithe they. Aur un mein se ek apne sathi ko gali deta tha, ghazab-naak, us ka chehra surkh ho gaya tha. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Beshak main aisa kalima janta hun, agar wo kahe to us se jo pata hai door ho jaye. Agar kahe: Main Allah se shaitan mardood ki panah mangta hun]. Phir unhon ne us shakhs se kaha: Kya tum nahi sunte jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmate hain? Us ne kaha: Beshak main majnoon nahi hun."
"1678","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: [Jab tum mein se ek lade to chehre se bache]."
"1679","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs masjid mein guzra jabke us ke sath teer they. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: [Us ke phalon ko pakdo]."
"1680","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: [Jab tum mein se ek hamari masjid ya hamare bazar mein guzre jabke us ke sath teer hon to use chahiye ke us ke phalon ko pakde. Ya farmaya wo apni hatheli se pakde. Ke Musalmanon mein se kisi ko us mein se koi cheez lage]."
"1681","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: [Tum mein se koi apne bhai par hathyar se ishara na kare. Kyunke wo nahi janta, shayad shaitan us ke hath mein kheenche. Phir wo Aag ke garhe mein gire]."
"1682","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Jab aadmi raste mein chalta hua raste par kaante ki tehni paye to use peechhe kare. Phir Allah ne us ka shukr ada kiya. Phir use bakhsh diya]."
"1683","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Ek aurat ko billi mein azab diya gaya jisے us ne qaid kiya yahan tak ke wo mar gayi. Phir wo us mein Aag mein dakhil hui. Na us ne use khilaya, na pilaya jab use qaid kiya. Na us ne use chhora ke wo zameen ke keede khaye]."
"1684","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: [Jibreel mujhe padosi ki wasiyyat karte rahe yahan tak ke main ne gumaan kiya ke wo use waris banayenge]."
"1685","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Jibreel mujhe padosi ki wasiyyat karte rahe yahan tak ke main ne gumaan kiya ke wo use waris banayenge]."
"1686","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab Aap ke paas sawal karne wala aata ya Aap se hajat mangi jati to farmate: Sifarish karo, ajr diye jaoge. Aur Allah Apne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zaban par jo chahe faisla farmata hai."
"1687","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Nek aur bure hum-nasheen ki misal itr uthane wale aur bhatti dhonkne wale jaisi hai. Phir itr uthane wala ya tumhe dega, ya tum us se khareedoge, ya us se umda khushboo paoge. Aur bhatti dhonkne wala ya tumhare kapde jalayega, ya buri boo paoge."
"1688","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat apni do betiyon ke sath mangne aayi. Phir us ne mere paas khajoor ke siwa kuchh na paya. Phir main ne use di. Phir us ne use apni dono betiyon ke darmiyan taqseem kiya. Aur us mein se na khaya. Phir khadi hui aur nikli. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamare paas dakhil hue. Phir main ne Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo in betiyon mein se kisi cheez se aazmaya jaye, wo us ke liye Aag se parda hongi."
"1689","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Musalman ke teen bete na marte hon jo Aag mein dakhil ho, magar qasam poori hone tak."
"1690","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi. Phir us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mard tumhari hadith lekar gaye. Phir hamare liye apne aap se ek din rakho jis mein hum tumhare paas aayein. Tum hamein us mein se sikhayo jo Allah ne tumhe sikhaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Falan aur falan din, falan aur falan jagah jama ho jao. Phir wo jama huein. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas aaye. Phir unhe us mein se sikhaya jo Allah ne Aap ko sikhaya. Phir farmaya: Tum mein se koi aurat nahi jo apne aage apni aulad mein se teen pesh kare magar wo us ke liye Aag se parda honge. Phir un mein se ek aurat ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Do? Unhon ne kaha: Phir us ne do martaba doharaya. Phir farmaya: Aur do, aur do, aur do."
"1691","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah se Abd al-Rahman bin al-Asbahani ke hawale se, Zakwan se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se is jaisa. Aur Abd al-Rahman bin al-Asbahani se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hazim ko Abu Hurairah se suna, unhon ne kaha: Teen jo baloghat ko nahi pahunche."
"1692","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala jab bande se mohabbat karta hai to Jibreel ko pukarta hai: Beshak Allah ne falan se mohabbat ki hai. Phir tum us se mohabbat karo. Phir Jibreel us se mohabbat karta hai. Phir Jibreel aasman mein pukarta hai: Beshak Allah ne falan se mohabbat ki hai. Phir tum us se mohabbat karo. Phir aasman wale us se mohabbat karte hain. Aur zameen walon mein us ke liye qubool rakha jata hai."
"1693","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha: Qayamat kab hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne us ke liye kya tayyar kiya? Us ne kaha: Main ne us ke liye zyada namaz, roza, sadqa tayyar nahi kiya. Lekin main Allah aur Us ke Rasool se mohabbat karta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Tum us ke sath ho jis se tum ne mohabbat ki."
"1694","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaha gaya: Shakhs qaum se mohabbat karta hai jabke wo un se nahi mila? Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi us ke sath hai jis se us ne mohabbat ki."
"1695","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hum se bayan farmaya, jabke Wo sache tasdeeq kiye gaye hain. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak tum mein se ek ki khalq us ki maan ke pet mein chalees din jama ki jati hai. Phir is jaisa jama hua khoon hota hai. Phir is jaisa gosht ka tukda hota hai. Phir Allah farishta bhejta hai. Phir use chaar kalimon ka hukm diya jata hai. Aur us se kaha jata hai: Us ka amal, rizq, muddat likho. Aur bad-bakht ya khush-bakht? Phir us mein rooh phunki jati hai. Phir tum mein se mard amal karta hai yahan tak ke us ke aur Jannat ke darmiyan gaz bhar ke siwa kuchh nahi hota. Phir us par us ki kitab sabqat le jati hai. Phir wo Dozakh walon ke amal karta hai. Aur amal karta hai yahan tak ke us ke aur Dozakh ke darmiyan gaz bhar ke siwa kuchh nahi hota. Phir us par kitab sabqat le jati hai. Phir wo Jannat walon ke amal karta hai."
